<%- include('../partials/head') %><%- include('../partials/header') %>
<main id="main" class="welcome-page" data-welcome>
  <section class="welcome-hero"><div class="welcome-copy"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR CAMPUS. A LITTLE MORE CONNECTED.</span><h1>Less waiting<br>More <em>getting there</em></h1><p>Find your bus before you leave. Follow its journey from a driver's phone to your screen, and make your next move with a little more confidence.</p><div class="welcome-actions"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="/signup">Get started <%- include('../partials/icon',{name:'arrow'}) %></a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/student">View demo</a></div><p class="welcome-caption">No tracking hardware needed. Built around the phones you already have.</p></div><div class="welcome-visual"><%- include('../partials/route-art') %><div class="journey-ticket"><span>THE EVERYDAY JOURNEY</span><div><strong>Your phone</strong><%- include('../partials/icon',{name:'arrow'}) %><strong>Your campus</strong></div><p>Location shared by choice. Updated as you move.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="welcome-benefits" aria-label="What makes Cosine useful"><article><%- include('../partials/icon',{name:'pin'}) %><div><h2>Know where it is</h2><p>Follow recent GPS positions on a real map.</p></div></article><article><%- include('../partials/icon',{name:'clock'}) %><div><h2>Make the wait yours</h2><p>Choose a pickup stop and check the latest update.</p></div></article><article><%- include('../partials/icon',{name:'shield'}) %><div><h2>Share on your terms</h2><p>Drivers control when a journey becomes visible.</p></div></article></section>
  <section id="how-it-works" class="welcome-how"><div class="welcome-section-title"><span class="eyebrow">SIMPLE BY DESIGN</span><h2>Two sides<br><em>One connected journey</em></h2><p>A driver shares from their phone. Everyone waiting gets a clearer picture.</p></div><div class="role-cards"><article class="role-card"><span class="role-label"><%- include('../partials/icon',{name:'grid'}) %>FOR STUDENTS</span><h3>Leave the guesswork behind</h3><ol><li>Find your bus or route.</li><li>Choose your pickup stop.</li><li>Follow the latest position and estimated arrival.</li></ol><a href="/student" class="text-button">Open student dashboard <%- include('../partials/icon',{name:'arrow'}) %></a></article><article class="role-card role-driver"><span class="role-label"><%- include('../partials/icon',{name:'bus'}) %>FOR DRIVERS</span><h3>Your phone keeps everyone in the loop</h3><ol><li>Connect your assigned bus.</li><li>Start a trip and allow GPS.</li><li>Share while you drive. Stop when you're done.</li></ol><a href="/driver" class="text-button">Open driver tracking <%- include('../partials/icon',{name:'arrow'}) %></a></article></div></section>
  <section class="welcome-assurance"><div><span class="eyebrow">CLARITY, EVEN WHEN THE SIGNAL ISN'T PERFECT</span><h2>A lost connection shouldn't look like a live bus</h2><p>Old GPS markers disappear automatically. Accuracy and last-update times stay visible, so you can tell a live journey from an uncertain one.</p></div><a href="/help" class="btn btn-outline">How tracking works <%- include('../partials/icon',{name:'arrow'}) %></a></section>
</main><%- include('../partials/footer') %>
